config F286_RADIO_UMS9117
	bool "Ruio F286 baseband radio and DSP bring-up"
	depends on ARCH_UMS9117
	help
	  Bring-up driver for the Ruio F286 baseband: the stock whale-die
	  power-on sequence (AON gate sets, keyed 0x40310008 step-0,
	  analog-die ADI batch, radio-on set) and the GSM/LTE DSP boot
	  sequences (firmware copies into the DSP DRAM region below the Linux
	  memory base, boot address, start control, reset release, command
	  queue poll), driven from sysfs. Exposes radio_power, load_lte,
	  load_gsm, status and binary attributes for the DSP AP windows.
	  Touches no hardware until a user writes the attributes.

	  This is a research driver: the LTE DSP does not start yet and the
	  phone hangs about a second after load_lte. Say N unless you are
	  working on the F286 radio.
